Why:
- Rerun serving, background viewer processes, and browser automation checks produce runtime artifacts that should not be accidentally staged.
- Playwright-style checks commonly create report and result directories even when used only for local visualization debugging.

How:
- Added ignore patterns for Playwright report/result directories.
- Added generic runtime log and pid ignores while keeping existing eval_results-specific ignore behavior intact.

Validation:
- git check-ignore -v sample.log sample.pid playwright-report/index.html test-results/output.json eval_results/logs/rerun_viewer_9090.log
